      "notes": [
        "Players who logged into Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Links during the following time periods would receive an appropriate \"Log-in Gift\" in their Gift Boxes. As such, it was possible to receive some (or all) of these gifts at the same time, if the player did not log in to receive a gift on an earlier day.",
        "Additionally, this campaign marked the debut of a 3D Summoning animation for \"Junk Warrior\" (for Yusei Fudo), as well as a new Skill for Yusei: \"Tuning\". Players would receive the Skill in their Gift Boxes upon their first log-in to Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Links during the campaign."
